  {
   "rating": 1,
   "date": "2026-09-26T22:03:55-05:00",
   "body": "Did all other quest in Ruins of Ban'aethal and Shrine of Akir  and got zero to drop. \r\nI was heading back to town and last ditch started killing the mobs in the bowl North of Valanaar and ended up getting them to drop.\r\nIt took 43 to get all 10.\r\nThis quest ill be next to impossible on launch unless they massively increase drops rates, good luck!",
